<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Profile Card</title>
<style>
 /* width will include padding and border (easier maths!) */
 * { box-sizing: border-box; }
 body { margin: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #eef6f2; }
 /* sticky = stays at the top while you scroll */
 header {
 position: sticky;
 top: 0;
 z-index: 10;
 background: #12003a;
 color: white;
 padding: 14px;
 text-align: center;
 }
 .card {
 width: 280px;
 margin: 24px auto;
 background: white;
 border: 2px solid #2f3eba;
 border-radius: 16px;
 padding: 20px;
 text-align: center;
 }
 /* 50% radius = perfect circle */
 .avatar {
 width: 90px;
 height: 90px;
 border-radius: 50%;
 background: #2f5bea;
 color: white;
 font-size: 36px;
 line-height: 90px;
 margin: 0 auto 10px;
 }
 /* fixed height + overflow auto = scroll bar */
 .bio {
 height: 80px;
 overflow: auto;
 text-align: left;
 border: 1px solid #ccd;
 padding: 8px;
 margin-top: 12px;
 font-size: 14px;
 }
 /* fixed = always at the same place on screen */
 .fab {
 position: fixed;
 right: 16px;
 bottom: 16px;
 width: 52px;
 height: 52px;
 border: 0;
 border-radius: 50%;
 background: #ffb703;
 font-size: 26px;
 }
</style>
</head>
<body>
 <header>My Profile Page</header>
 <div class="card"> 
 <div class="avatar">A</div>
 <h2><b>ABHINAV SINGH</b></h2>
 <p>Web Developer</p>
 <div class="bio">
 Hi! I am Abhinav Singh, a first-year BTech CSE student specializing in Artificial Intelligence. I started learning coding this year and enjoy exploring new technologies, solving coding problems, and creating websites. I am currently learning Java, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. My goal is to become an AI engineer and build my own applications. I believe in learning step by step and improving my skills every day.
 </div>
 </div>
 <button class="fab">+</button>
</body>
</html>